{"id":"7b38989d3b24072d","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-forcing11-quotient-forcing.md","title":"ZFC Forcing11 Quotient Forcing","display":"df-zfc-forcing11-quotient-forcing — ZFC Forcing11 Quotient Forcing","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing11-quotient-forcing","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing11-quotient-forcing","58-df-zfc-forcing2-quotient-forcing"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing11-quotient-forcing — ZFC Forcing11 Quotient Forcing","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-forcing]]","[[58-df-filter]]","[[58-df-poset]]","[[58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-embedding]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing11-quotient-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing11-quotient-forcing</span><span>58-df-zfc-forcing2-quotient-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing11-quotient-forcing — ZFC Forcing11 Quotient Forcing"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d06ac5a66d69d291\" href=\"?note=d06ac5a66d69d291\" title=\"58-df-forcing\">58-df-forcing</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1331244a5201bb99\" href=\"?note=1331244a5201bb99\" title=\"58-df-filter\">58-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"58-df-poset\">58-df-poset</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6d19484c6bfee7df\" href=\"?note=6d19484c6bfee7df\" title=\"58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-embedding\">58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-embedding</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S,P,R_P,Q,R_Q,e,G\\in V\">\\(S,P,R_P,Q,R_Q,e,G\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\\subseteq P\">\\(G\\subseteq P\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11QuotientForcing}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2QuotientForcing}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11QuotientForcing}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2QuotientForcing}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11QuotientForcing}_S(S,Q,R_Q,P,R_P,e,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,R_P,Q,R_Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,R_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land S=\\{q\\in Q:\\forall p\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in Q\\;\n(\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in R_Q\\land\n\\langle r,e(p)\\rangle\\in R_Q)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11QuotientForcing}_S(S,Q,R_Q,P,R_P,e,G)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,R_P,Q,R_Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,R_P)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land S=\\{q\\in Q:\\forall p\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in Q\\;\n(\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in R_Q\\land\n\\langle r,e(p)\\rangle\\in R_Q)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2QuotientForcing}_S(S,Q,R_Q,P,R_P,e,G)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11QuotientForcing}_S(S,Q,R_Q,P,R_P,e,G).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2QuotientForcing}_S(S,Q,R_Q,P,R_P,e,G)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11QuotientForcing}_S(S,Q,R_Q,P,R_P,e,G).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The quotient is formed from a larger forcing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> over a completely embedded subforcing <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>; its conditions are precisely those compatible in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> with every image of a condition in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><code>58-df-zfc-forcing2-quotient-forcing</code> is merged here; it used the same compatibility-with-generic-filter quotient condition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-forcing","status":"resolved","id":"d06ac5a66d69d291","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-forcing]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"1331244a5201bb99","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-poset","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-poset]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"6d19484c6bfee7df","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-forcing-complete-embedding]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S,P,R_P,Q,R_Q,e,G\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"G\\subseteq P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11QuotientForcing}_S,\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2QuotientForcing}_S\\subseteq V^7","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11QuotientForcing}_S(S,Q,R_Q,P,R_P,e,G)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcingCompleteEmbedding}_S(e,P,R_P,Q,R_Q)\n\\land\\mathrm{Filter}_S(G,P,R_P)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land S=\\{q\\in Q:\\forall p\\in G\\;\\exists r\\in Q\\;\n(\\langle r,q\\rangle\\in R_Q\\land\n\\langle r,e(p)\\rangle\\in R_Q)\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing11\\text{-}quotient\\text{-}forcing}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2QuotientForcing}_S(S,Q,R_Q,P,R_P,e,G)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcForcing11QuotientForcing}_S(S,Q,R_Q,P,R_P,e,G).","display":true},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false}],"bytes":1700,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2034","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-forcing11-quotient-forcing.md|58-df-zfc-forcing11-quotient-forcing]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","d06ac5a66d69d291","1331244a5201bb99","d3f859dbdd37f018","6d19484c6bfee7df"]}